<title>UK: IBCA says rates Banco Urquijo BBB plus long-term.</title>
<headline>IBCA says rates Banco Urquijo BBB plus long-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Wednesday it assigned a long-term rating of BBB plus to Spain's Banco Urquijo.</p>
<p>Its short-term rating of A2, individual rating of C and legal rating of 4 have been affirmed, IBCA said in a statement.  </p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6176</p>
</text>
